WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.691 --> 00:00:04.293
&gt;&gt; Chris: FINALLY TONIGHT,

00:00:03.325 --> 00:00:07.096
THIS WEEK’S NOTABLE

00:00:04.427 --> 00:00:08.864
QUOTABLES.

00:00:07.229 --> 00:00:09.665
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE AN ECONOMY THAT’S

00:00:08.998 --> 00:00:10.032
MOVING IN THE RIGHT

00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:11.534
DIRECTION.

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:12.869
IT’S BOOMING.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:14.036
&gt;&gt; WE ARE LOOKING LIVE AT

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.638
POINT TERMS WE HAVE NEVER

00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:16.472
SEEN.

00:00:15.771 --> 00:00:17.807
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OF

00:00:16.606 --> 00:00:18.808
STAFF HAVE HAD FULL

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.709
CONFIDENCE AND TRUST IN HIS

00:00:18.941 --> 00:00:20.109
ABILITIES AND HIS

00:00:19.842 --> 00:00:21.678
PERFORMANCE.

00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:24.447
&gt;&gt; I TOLD THEM ALL OF THE

00:00:21.811 --> 00:00:25.848
DETAILS OF MY MARRIAGE,

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.349
INCLUDING VERBAL AND

00:00:25.982 --> 00:00:28.017
EMOTIONAL ABUSE.

00:00:26.482 --> 00:00:28.785
&gt;&gt; I THINK A LOT OF US COULD

00:00:28.151 --> 00:00:31.654
HAVE DONE BETTER.

00:00:28.918 --> 00:00:33.690
&gt;&gt; COMEY IS GONE, MCCABE

00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:36.526
LETTER THE FBI.

00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:40.363
LISA PAGE BEEN DEMOTED.

00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:40.764
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTE.

00:00:40.497 --> 00:00:42.465
[WHISPERING]

00:00:40.897 --> 00:00:44.000
&gt;&gt; OMAROSA WAS FIRED THREE

00:00:42.599 --> 00:00:45.435
TIMES ON THE APPRENTICE.

00:00:44.134 --> 00:00:46.503
AND THIS IS THE FOURTH YOU

00:00:45.569 --> 00:00:48.305
TIME WE LET HER GO.

00:00:46.636 --> 00:00:49.673
&gt;&gt; WE ARE TRAVELING TO THE

00:00:48.438 --> 00:00:51.608
OLYMPICS TO MAKE SURE THAT

00:00:49.806 --> 00:00:53.510
NORTH KOREA DOESN’T PAPER

00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:53.844
OVER THE TRUTH ABOUT THEIR

00:00:53.643 --> 00:00:55.345
REGIME.

00:00:53.977 --> 00:00:56.813
&gt;&gt; I WOULD DESCRIBE IT,

00:00:55.479 --> 00:00:57.714
DANA, AS A COLLECTIVE EYE

00:00:56.947 --> 00:00:59.016
ROLL FROM MILITARY LEADERS

00:00:57.848 --> 00:01:00.617
WHO HAVE I SPOKEN TO.

00:00:59.149 --> 00:01:01.184
MOST THOUGHT IT WAS A JOKE

00:01:00.751 --> 00:01:02.953
AT FIRST.

